      "section": "2. Remove the tray.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 732.29,
        "r": 415.7900000000001,
        "b": 720.7
      },
      "content": "Lift the front of the tray, and then pull it out of the printer to remove it."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_3913",
      "reading_order": 5360,
      "section": "2. Remove the tray.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 708.79,
        "r": 537.6900400000002,
        "b": 685.2
      },
      "content": "NOTE: If the tray has Fixed Tray Guides installed and are still required, move the hardware to new tray. If necessary, order new kit: 3GY19-67901 Kit-Fixed Tray Guide. Only one kit required per engine."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_3914",
      "reading_order": 5361,
      "section": "2. Remove the tray.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.0,
        "t": 433.42,
        "r": 227.24999999999991,
        "b": 421.83
      },
      "content": "Remove the formatter cover."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_3915",
      "reading_order": 5362,
      "section": "2. Remove the tray.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 112.99998,
        "t": 414.0,
        "r": 230.10997999999995,
        "b": 399.91
      },
      "content": "▲ Do one of the following:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_3916",
      "reading_order": 5363,
      "section": "2. Remove the tray.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 112.99997,
        "t": 390.80953,
        "r": 511.0199700000003,
        "b": 367.21952999999996
      },
      "content": "M501: Remove one screw (callout 1), and then slide the cover toward the rear of the printer to remove it (callout 2)."
